                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRIMARY vs SECONDARY USES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Direct patient care vs everything else</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"170\" width=\"500\" height=\"800\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PRIMARY USES</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Direct patient care</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"295\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Documentation</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Chronological account of care</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"405\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Communication</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Handoffs across providers and shifts</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"515\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Continuity of Care</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Next clinician knows prior plan</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"625\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"665\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Treatment Planning</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Basis for clinical decisions</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"735\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Patient Education</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Consent and instructions given</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"845\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Legal Protection</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Evidence of care provided</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"170\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">SECONDARY USES</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Beyond direct care</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"295\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Reimbursement</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Coded claims to payers</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"405\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Quality Improvement</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Measures, benchmarks, accreditation</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"515\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Research</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">IRB studies, registries, reviews</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"625\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"665\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Education</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Residents, students, fellows</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"735\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Public Health</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Reportable diseases, registries</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"845\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Legal Proceedings</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Malpractice, workers' comp</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1000\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1045\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SAME RECORD — every secondary use depends on primary quality</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Primary uses serve the patient in front of you. Secondary uses serve everyone else who depends on the data."
