                  "explanation": "DNV GL Healthcare's NIAHO standards integrate CMS Conditions of Participation with the international ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System framework. DNV is unique among hospital deeming accreditors in conducting ANNUAL surveys, building a continuous-improvement discipline rather than the 3-year preparation-and-survey rhythm characteristic of TJC and HFAP. AAAHC accredits ambulatory care (not hospitals) and uses a 3-year cycle. The annual cadence and ISO foundation are the two key facts DNV is tested on.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">ISO 9001 + annual surveys</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"1000\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">DNV - THE UNIQUE COMBINATION</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- NIAHO + CMS CoPs + ISO 9001:2015</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"325\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Annual on-site survey</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Continuous improvement discipline</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Process-based, outcome-focused</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"460\" width=\"500\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">TJC</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">3-year cycle</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Chapter-based standards</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"640\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Tracer methodology</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"675\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">~80% market</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"460\" width=\"480\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">HFAP / AAAHC</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">HFAP: hospitals, 3-yr</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">AAAHC: amb/ASC, 3-yr</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"640\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Both have CMS deeming</text><text x=\"610\" y=\"675\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Neither uses ISO 9001</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"740\" width=\"1000\" height=\"270\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">WHY DNV DIFFERS</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"845\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- ISO methodology proven across industries</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Annual rhythm means \"every day is survey day\"</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"915\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Less prescriptive than TJC chapters</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"950\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Some hospitals switch DNV-&gt;TJC and back</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"985\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Documentation requirements still map to CoP</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "DNV = NIAHO + ISO 9001 + Annual surveys"
                  }
