                  "explanation": "LOINC (Logical Observation Identifiers Names and Codes), developed and maintained by the Regenstrief Institute, is the recognized standard for lab tests, clinical observations, and survey instruments. It is required by ONC certification for lab results exchange. ICD-10-CM is for diagnoses, RxNorm is for medications, and NDC identifies drug products at the package level.",
