                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">EHR PROJECT PLAYBOOK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Seven HIM contributions</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">1.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Map every data element</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">field, code, owner, downstream flow</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"290\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">2.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Sit on the CDS committee</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">override data, alert tuning, retirements</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"400\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">3.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Audit ROI workflows</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Info Blocking compliance, logging</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"510\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">4.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Lead MPI quality program</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"590\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">duplicates weekly, overlays daily</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">5.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Champion training quality</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">accurate docs, coded fields, no copy-paste</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"730\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">6.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Plan for upgrades</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Epic quarterly, Cerner monthly cadence</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"840\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"890\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">7.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"890\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Build deficiency dashboard</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">open records, late entries, missing signatures</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"960\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\" rx=\"25\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"993\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Be indispensable to the EHR governance process</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Seven concrete ways HIM shapes EHR outcomes"
